    website: "https://github.com/488315"
version: "0.2.1"
date-released: 2026-08-13
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/488315/DeafBench"
url: "https://488315.github.io/products/deafbench/"
abstract: >-
  DeafBench is an open-source accessibility benchmark for AI captions and
  automatic speech recognition systems. It keeps conventional ASR measurements
  separate from typed accessibility-critical information evaluation and from
  its pinned Open ASR Leaderboard compatibility lane.
keywords:
  - accessibility
  - automatic speech recognition
  - captions
  - deaf
  - hard of hearing
  - benchmark
